WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.767
-Welcome back to the show,
everybody.

00:00:02.767 --> 00:00:05.200
It is time to play a game that
combines pumpkins and painting.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.501
It's time for
the Pumpkin Paint Challenge.

00:00:07.501 --> 00:00:09.934
-♪ Pumpkin ♪

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.968
♪ Paint ♪

00:00:11.968 --> 00:00:13.400
♪ Challenge ♪

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.467
-Now, this is, of course,
the game

00:00:15.467 --> 00:00:17.701
where two audience members
compete to paint a pumpkin.

00:00:17.701 --> 00:00:19.334
Let's see who's playing tonight.

00:00:19.334 --> 00:00:22.033
Come on over.
Hello. Nice to see you.

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:23.767
-Roy Fuentes.

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:25.467
-What is your name,
and where are you from?

00:00:25.467 --> 00:00:27.033
-Roy Fuentes, Baytown, Texas.

00:00:27.033 --> 00:00:28.834
-Hey, welcome.
Thanks for being here.

00:00:28.834 --> 00:00:29.901
Texas. I love it.
Hey.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:31.000
-Hello.
-How you doing?

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:32.300
What's your name,
and where are you from?

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:34.534
-My name's Diana, and I'm
from Burlington, New Jersey.

00:00:34.534 --> 00:00:38.000
-Hey! Come on.
A local advantage there.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.501
Now, here's how this works.

00:00:39.501 --> 00:00:41.667
You each have a pumpkin
and some paint,

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.567
and whoever can paint
their pumpkin better

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.000
will be declared champion

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:46.501
and go home
with a very special prize.

00:00:46.501 --> 00:00:51.434
And the thing that you will be
painting is me, my face.

00:00:51.434 --> 00:00:54.000
So why don't you head on over
there to the sides over here.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.567
You have all the paint
I think you need.

00:00:55.567 --> 00:00:56.701
Grab your paint.

00:00:56.701 --> 00:00:58.234
We're gonna put one minute
on the clock.

00:00:58.234 --> 00:01:02.734
So it's kind of a fast thing.
And you're painting my face.

00:01:02.734 --> 00:01:05.367
I'm like a live model for you.

00:01:05.367 --> 00:01:08.033
Ready? Set.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.868
Why did you grab a bigger brush?

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:12.334
So rude. Very rude.
Rude off the bat.

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:15.200
Alright, but who knows?
Ready, set. Go!

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:16.734
This is great.
Here we go.

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:17.934
One minute.

00:01:17.934 --> 00:01:21.701
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:21.701 --> 00:01:23.300
Can't see what they're doing.

00:01:23.300 --> 00:01:25.400
This is fantastic.
Alright.

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:27.968
We're down to 50 seconds here.

00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:29.868
Very, very interesting.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:29.868 --> 00:01:30.934
You're already getting
some applause.

00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:32.267
Some people can see.

00:01:32.267 --> 00:01:34.734
Are you an artist at all?

00:01:34.734 --> 00:01:36.601
No. You're not. Are you?
Are you an artist?

00:01:36.601 --> 00:01:38.234
-Nope.
-No.

00:01:38.234 --> 00:01:39.734
Neither one of you have any --

00:01:39.734 --> 00:01:41.467
Any background in painting or --

00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.300
No.
-No, sir. No, sir.

00:01:43.300 --> 00:01:46.033
My wife's a teacher,
kindergarten teacher.

00:01:46.033 --> 00:01:47.467
She should have been up here
instead of me.

00:01:47.467 --> 00:01:49.100
-Oh, yeah. Okay, good. Alright.
So that's interesting.

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:52.033
And no background in art at all
or any of that stuff?

00:01:52.033 --> 00:01:54.434
-No.
-Are you crafty at all?

00:01:54.434 --> 00:01:58.300
-Like, I do musical stuff
but not anything like this.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:00.467
-Oh, okay.
Are you --

00:02:00.467 --> 00:02:02.067
Do you have a --

00:02:02.067 --> 00:02:04.501
Do you have a Halloween costume
you're going to wear this year?

00:02:04.501 --> 00:02:06.701
-Oh, yeah.
Commando, maybe, kilt.

00:02:06.701 --> 00:02:08.734
-Okay. Yeah. Okay.

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:10.400
We have six seconds left.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.767
Five seconds left.

00:02:11.767 --> 00:02:14.701
Okay.
Three, two, one.

00:02:14.701 --> 00:02:17.367
Time's up.
Paint brushes down.

00:02:17.367 --> 00:02:20.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.701
Now let's see how you did.

00:02:22.701 --> 00:02:26.501
Contestant number two,
we're going to start with you.

00:02:26.501 --> 00:02:27.634
Here we go.

00:02:27.634 --> 00:02:30.067
[ Drum roll ]

00:02:30.067 --> 00:02:32.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:37.601 --> 00:02:39.133
I like him.

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:40.968
I think he's --
I think he's cute.

00:02:40.968 --> 00:02:42.234
I like this guy.
Alright.

00:02:42.234 --> 00:02:43.267
You did a great job.

00:02:43.267 --> 00:02:44.367
Contestant number one,
good to see you.

00:02:44.367 --> 00:02:46.334
Let's see how you did here.

00:02:46.334 --> 00:02:48.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:53.334 --> 00:02:55.300
Wow.

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.801
And this is --
You're actually very talented.

00:02:58.801 --> 00:03:01.334
This is going to be
a tough call here.

00:03:01.334 --> 00:03:03.734
Audience, what do you think?
Is it this one?

00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:06.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:06.434 --> 00:03:08.567
Or is it this one.

00:03:08.567 --> 00:03:11.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:11.968 --> 00:03:13.300
I think it's you.
Congratulations.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:14.667
You're the winner.

00:03:14.667 --> 00:03:16.267
You're the Pumpkin Paint
champion,

00:03:16.267 --> 00:03:20.801
and as winner,
you'll be going home with $100

00:03:20.801 --> 00:03:25.100
and a signed pumpkin
spice latte by me, but...

00:03:25.100 --> 00:03:27.133
they spelled my name wrong
at the top/

00:03:27.133 --> 00:03:29.033
They put Jeremy Fallon,
so that's good.

00:03:29.033 --> 00:03:30.033
But there you go.

00:03:30.033 --> 00:03:31.133
Thank you very much.
Congratulations.

00:03:31.133 --> 00:03:32.534
Thank you for playing.
Stick around.

00:03:32.534 --> 00:03:33.968
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

